      "/home/alex/projects/RAG/full-stack-fastapi-template/.venv/lib/python3.14/site-packages/langchain_core/utils/pydantic.py:42: UserWarning: Core Pydantic V1 functionality isn't compatible with Python 3.14 or greater.\n",
